    {"kind":"grammar_point","external_id":"g_a2_will_prediction","data":{"lesson_key":"a2-seasons-weather-plans-01","slug":"a2-will-weather-predictions","title":"will for simple predictions","rule_summary":"Use will + base verb for a simple future prediction, especially when reporting a forecast or expectation.","explanation":{"fa":"برای پیش‌بینی ساده آینده، مخصوصاً بر اساس پیش‌بینی هوا یا انتظار کلی، از will + شکل ساده فعل استفاده می‌کنیم."},"examples":[{"en":"It will rain later.","fa":"بعداً باران میاد."},{"en":"The temperature will drop tonight.","fa":"امشب دما پایین میاد."}],"cefr":"A2","status":"approved"}},
    {"kind":"grammar_point","external_id":"g_a2_weather_so_because","data":{"lesson_key":"a2-seasons-weather-plans-02","slug":"a2-weather-because-so","title":"Reason and result with because / so","rule_summary":"Use because to introduce a reason and so to introduce a result.","explanation":{"fa":"because دلیل را معرفی می‌کند و so نتیجه را."},"examples":[{"en":"I'm taking a jacket because it'll be cold.","fa":"ژاکت می‌برم چون هوا سرد می‌شه."},{"en":"It'll rain, so we're eating inside.","fa":"باران میاد، پس داخل غذا می‌خوریم."}],"cefr":"A2","status":"approved"}},

    {"kind":"dialogue","external_id":"d_a2_weather_picnic","data":{"lesson_key":"a2-seasons-weather-plans-01","title":"Picnic or not?","setting":"home","cefr":"A2","topic":"weather","characters":["Lena","Marco"],"turns":[{"order":1,"speaker":"Lena","text":"Did you check the forecast for tomorrow?","translation_fa":"پیش‌بینی فردا رو دیدی؟"},{"order":2,"speaker":"Marco","text":"Yeah. It'll be sunny in the morning, but it will rain later.","translation_fa":"آره. صبح آفتابیه، ولی بعداً باران میاد."},{"order":3,"speaker":"Lena","text":"Then let's have the picnic early.","translation_fa":"پس پیک‌نیک رو زودتر برگزار کنیم."},{"order":4,"speaker":"Marco","text":"Good idea. It may get windy in the afternoon too.","translation_fa":"فکر خوبیه. ممکنه بعدازظهر باد هم بیاد."}],"status":"approved"}},
    {"kind":"dialogue","external_id":"d_a2_weather_season","data":{"lesson_key":"a2-seasons-weather-plans-02","title":"Visiting in spring","setting":"phone call","cefr":"A2","topic":"weather","characters":["Rosa","Paul"],"turns":[{"order":1,"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What's spring like there?","translation_fa":"بهار اونجا چه‌جوریه؟"},{"order":2,"speaker":"Paul","text":"Usually mild, but evenings can be cool.","translation_fa":"معمولاً ملایمه، ولی عصرها ممکنه خنک باشه."},{"order":3,"speaker":"Rosa","text":"So should I bring a jacket?","translation_fa":"پس ژاکت بیارم؟"},{"order":4,"speaker":"Paul","text":"Yes, definitely. And bring an umbrella too.","translation_fa":"بله، حتماً. چتر هم بیار."}],"status":"approved"}},

